    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Verifies that {@link FileAlterationObserver#checkAndNotify()} correctly detects newly created files regardless of where their names fall in alphabetical order relative to existing entries. <p>The test proceeds in several phases: <ol> <li>Baseline scan: no changes expected.</li> <li>Create a subdirectory and two files (file2, file4); verify only the physically created files are reported.</li> <li>Idle scan: listener collections should be empty again after reset.</li> <li>Add file1 whose name sorts <em>before</em> every existing entry; verify detection.</li> <li>Add file3 whose name sorts <em>between</em> two existing entries; verify detection.</li> <li>Add file5 whose name sorts <em>after</em> every existing entry; verify detection.</li> </ol> @throws IOException if an I/O error occurs."
   },
